<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange fell in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.33, off 1.05.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 230 to 314.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,873,585 compared with 26,664,525 Monday.</p>
<p>		 (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
